OL,3,GNEWSAComic says winning cheesiest joke
OL,4,Aaward 'is bonkers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA comedian has said "it's bonkers" to
OL,7,Fhave scooped the top prize for the
OL,8,Fcheesiest joke of the year at his first
OL,9,FEdinburgh Festival Fringe.
OL,11,FFil Milton runs the Make The Ferret Mad
OL,12,FAgain comedy nights at The Ferret in
OL,13,FPreston, Lancashire.
OL,15,FHe said he has been doing stand-up for
OL,16,Ffour years after being inspired by Mark
OL,17,FSimmons' one-liners at the Fringe in
OL,18,F2021.
